erges-for-third-party-eval-0-e3e0524cc2/","observation_id":"obs_e3e0524cc29a68a0c454c791e47c3f7d5fdce13c965ce369006aabf390c342e2","published_at":"2026-09-15T04:50:36Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一条关于AI安全评估标准化的动态报道。AEF-1是由行业论坛发布的基线标准，旨在规范第三方评估机构的独立性要求，包括访问权限、利益冲突管理、资金关系、回避机制和信息披露等维度。已有前沿AI企业承诺向符合该标准的外部评估团队提供类似内部员工的办公权限。","title":"[AINews] AEF-1 standard emerges for Third Party Evaluators, as Xai, OpenAI, and Anthropic all cosign"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_851eced6dd5333dd8cbd96920b1425348242118d4905288c994297525c5c829b","internal_url":"/posts/20260915-blogs_podcasts-abnormal-ai-amazon-bedrock-agentcore-for-agentic-e-0-d1c93a9a41/","observation_id":"obs_d1c93a9a4173c0b28918d3112f7fd3c28bf7b7db15700155a6cac479db0c87d4","published_at":"2026-09-14T21:22:45Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"该内容介绍了一种将动态代码执行能力集成到 AI 代理中的方案，使代理能够执行计算、数据处理和验证等超出语义推理范围的任务，并展示了在邮件安全检测场景中的实际应用架构。","title":"Abnormal AI: Amazon Bedrock AgentCore for agentic email security at scale"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:AI Agent","id":"tag:AI Agent","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":63,"graph_node_id":"tag:大语言模型","id":"tag:大语言模型","jaccard":0.512195,"topic":"大语言模型"},{"cooccurrence":35,"graph_node_id":"tag:Prompt 工程","id":"tag:Prompt 工程","jaccard":0.284553,"topic":"Prompt 工程"},{"cooccurrence":27,"graph_node_id":"tag:生成式 AI","id":"tag:生成式 AI","jaccard":0.219512,"topic":"生成式 AI"},{"cooccurrence":20,"graph_node_id":"tag:Advanced (300)","id":"tag:Advanced (300)","jaccard":0.162602,"topic":"Advanced (300)"},{"cooccurrence":17,"graph_node_id":"tag:Announcements","id":"tag:Announcements","jaccard":0.138211,"topic":"Announcements"},{"cooccurrence":17,"graph_node_id":"tag:机器学习","id":"tag:机器学习","jaccard":0.138211,"topic":"机器学习"},{"cooccurrence":15,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock AgentCore","id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock AgentCore","jaccard":0.121951,"topic":"Amazon Bedrock AgentCore"},{"cooccurrence":14,"graph_n